            "desc": "Name the Arcron keeper whose app account may call `store`.\nCreator-only, one-time. Pass the keeper *application*, not a raw uint64. `store` authorizes Application(keeper).address - the inner-call sender when Arcron `execute()` inner-calls this app - never itob(keeper.id). Puya lowers the Application param to uint64 in the ABI signature; the compiled selector is set_keeper(uint64)void.",
