            },
            "readonly": false,
            "desc": "Arcron hook. Zero arguments; the selector is the only app arg.\nReturns the total seeds stored after this call, 0 on every no-work path. FAIL SOFT: after the two authorization asserts nothing here may reject - a failing hook gets exponentially backed off by keeper bots and burns upkeep escrow on retries.\nNo-work paths, all returning 0: target unset; either beacon key missing from the foreign read (get_ex ok flag, never asserted); revealed_round zero or already cached; seed not 32 bytes; ring box unavailable. On a fresh reveal: create the box if absent, write slot (stored % 8) * 40, bump stored and last_seen_round.",
            "events": [],
            "recommendations": {}
        },
        {
            "name": "read",
            "args": [
                {
                    "type": "uint64",
                    "name": "slot"
